{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "org.mai-mai.group-emoji-react",
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "name": "群聊贴表情",
  "description": "让麦麦在群聊里给消息贴 QQ 表情回应：发送通道可走 QQ 适配器插件（SnowLuma / NapCat 统一连接器，adapter.napcat.* / adapter.snowluma.*）或直连 Napcat HTTP，auto 优先适配器、失败自动回落；由 LLM 从 32 个内置表情（QQNT emojiId 表）中挑选，支持「麦麦主动贴」和「LLM 主动贴」两条路径。主动路径带双层 LLM 超时保护，可选关键词规则回退（rule_fallback，默认关闭：失败即跳过）。仅群聊生效，不发送文字、不打断正常聊天。",
  "author": {
    "name": "orge-8",
    "url": "https://github.com/orge-8"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/orge-8/group-emoji-react",
    "issues": "https://github.com/orge-8/group-emoji-react/issues"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.0.0",
    "max_version": "1.99.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.5.1",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "capabilities": [
    "api.call",
    "api.list",
    "llm.generate",
    "message.get_recent",
    "send.text"
  ],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN"
  }
}
